  "title": "InvenTrust Properties Corp. Launches Tender Offer for Up to $75 Million of its Common Stock",
  "summary": "InvenTrust Properties Corp. (InvenTrust or the Company) announced today that it is commencing a modified Dutch Auction self-tender offer (the Offer) to purchase for cash up to $75 million in value of shares of the Companys common stock. In accordance with the terms and subject to the conditions of the offer to purchase and letter of transmittal, InvenTrust will select the lowest price, which will not exceed $3.10 nor be less than $2.",
